[00:01.22]1. Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[00:07.34]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[00:08.30]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[00:12.68]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[00:12.68]By his love God made provision;
[00:12.68]We may freely take his hand.
[00:12.68]So we make our dedication;
[00:23.66]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[01:21.08]2. In this day of Satan’s anger,
[01:23.46]As the end is drawing ever near,
[01:23.46]We are faced with opposition
[01:23.46]That could make us turn away in fear.
[01:23.46]But Jehovah gives protection;
[01:27.98]Close to him we want to stay,
[01:30.14]That we might forever serve him.
[01:32.34]Love him loyally, never stray.
[01:33.88]3. Help for us God has provided
[01:35.53]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[01:35.53]Through the Christian congregation,
[01:35.53]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[01:35.53]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[01:35.53]He will help us do what’s right.
[01:35.53]He will help us to be loyal
[01:35.53]And walk modestly in his sight.
